{
  "_doc": "Parked or seasonal sources that source_health.py --probe re-tests (weekly from scrape_and_publish.ps1). kind: tribe (WP Events Calendar REST, alive when total>0), json (endpoint whose `path` list is non-empty), html (200 + `marker` regex >= `min` hits), status (200 at all). When one flips to alive, the phone alert names it and the market file gets the source key noted in `adopt`.",
